<li>Mey, F.S. 2013. The Nepenthes alata group: resurrection of N.&amp;nbsp;graciliflora ; N.&amp;nbsp;ramos and N.&amp;nbsp;negros described as new species. Strange Fruits: A Garden's Chronicle, August 27, 2013.</li>
